globalThis.STORY_ZW_WORK_EN = {
  wealth: {
    '紫微': { title:`Money that guards the throne`, story:`With Zi Wei in your Wealth palace, money follows your position and reputation. You earn by being trusted and given authority, not by sheer physical effort. You spend with taste, preferring to buy less but buy well, and now and then you pay a little extra to save face.`, scenes:[`You often pick up the bill at team dinners, then wince a little when the statement arrives.`,`When buying a bag or an appliance, you would rather wait a month for the one you really want than settle for a cheaper substitute.`], advice:`Set a monthly "image budget" and stop when it runs out; on payday, have the rest moved automatically into savings.` },
    '紫微·天府': { title:`A steward seated between two vaults`, story:`With Zi Wei and Tian Fu together in your Wealth palace, you have a natural steadiness with money: you know how to hold on to it and when to make a move. Income often comes from management roles or large organizations, and the more stable it is, the more you build up. Your blind spot is caution; when an opportunity shows up, you can think about it for too long.`, scenes:[`You may keep a budget you have tracked for years and can tell exactly which month you overspent by ten dollars.`,`When a friend asks you to co-own a shop, you want to see six months of projected revenue before you say yes.`], advice:`Set aside a small learning budget each year for classes or new skills, so stability does not turn into standing still.` },
    '紫微·天相': { title:`Money that feels safe once it is signed and stamped`, story:`With Zi Wei and Tian Xiang in your Wealth palace, your money does best inside a system: contracts, pay slips, clear rules for who gets what. You spend gracefully and by the rules and rarely buy on impulse, but social obligations and keeping up appearances cost you. When others split a bill sloppily, it bothers you more than it bothers them.`, scenes:[`On trips with friends, you volunteer as treasurer and photograph every receipt into a shared spreadsheet.`,`Wedding gifts, funeral contributions, birthday presents: you worry about giving too little, and in some months they add up to more than your utility bills.`], advice:`Open a separate account for social and gift spending, set a ceiling at the start of the year, and once you hit it, let a heartfelt gesture stand in for a bigger amount.` },
    '紫微·破軍': { title:`Tearing down the old house to build a new one`, story:`With Zi Wei and Po Jun in your Wealth palace, your finances move in big cycles of breaking and rebuilding: you often spend first, and that spending opens the door to the next wave of income. You are willing to put money behind a new idea and you are not afraid to start from zero. Your blind spot is the swing between flush and tight: you spend freely when money is there and grit your teeth when it is not.`, scenes:[`To change careers you might sign up for three courses at once without a second thought at checkout.`,`When you move, you replace all the old furniture, and only at the end of the month notice how much lower your savings are.`], advice:`Before any big expense, make sure three months of living costs are still in the bank, so a fresh start rests on a cushion rather than on luck.` },
    '紫微·七殺': { title:`Supplies won by leading the troops`, story:`With Zi Wei and Qi Sha in your Wealth palace, you go after money with drive; once you set a target you want to take it in one go, and pressure brings out your best results. What matters to you is being in control of how you earn, and you dislike anyone putting a cap on your income. You spend decisively, sometimes too quickly.`, scenes:[`The moment annual targets are announced, you have already lined up in your head which clients to visit first.`,`You see a car you like, sign on the day of the test drive, and only start working out the monthly payments on the drive home.`], advice:`For anything costing more than a month's income, give yourself forty-eight hours to cool off before deciding.` },
    '紫微·貪狼': { title:`Golden cups passed around the banquet`, story:`With Zi Wei and Tan Lang in your Wealth palace, money often flows in through your network, your social life and your many interests; you know how to enjoy yourself and how to earn. You have good taste and do not hold back on food, travel or a beautiful life. Your blind spot is that with more socializing and more wants, money slips away without you noticing.`, scenes:[`At a friend's birthday party you meet your next business partner, and also put half a month's food budget on your card.`,`You have several hobbies, from photography to wine to crafts, and you have bought the full kit for each one.`], advice:`Pick just one hobby to spend on each month and put the rest on a wish list; next month, see if you still want them.` },
    '天機': { title:`A mind that calculates faster than anyone`, story:`With Tian Ji in your Wealth palace, you earn with your head and your ideas; you compare prices, make plans and often think up several ways to bring in income. Money comes in flexibly and goes out just as quickly, with lots of small transactions. {{B:天機:When Tian Ji is strong, your planning is clear and it works.|When Tian Ji is weak, you tend to overthink and keep changing course, and the constant switching means little gets saved.}}`, scenes:[`Buying a vacuum cleaner, you might open ten tabs to compare specs and still wait for the anniversary sale to order.`,`You have switched budgeting apps three times, each time sure the next one would be better.`], advice:`Choose one way of saving and stick with it for at least six months before judging it; let your cleverness go into persistence.` },
    '天機·太陰': { title:`A ledger worked out carefully by moonlight`, story:`With Tian Ji and Tai Yin in your Wealth palace, your money mostly comes from a steady salary and professional skill, built up bit by bit through care. You manage money with precision and watch every cent, which also means you can worry yourself into anxiety. When income or plans shift, part of you always wants one more layer of protection.`, scenes:[`On payday you split the money into envelopes for rent, living costs and a travel fund.`,`When a friend changes jobs for a raise, you might lie awake all night wondering whether you should make a move too.`], advice:`Set a "peace of mind" level for your savings, and once you reach it, allow yourself to worry a little less.` },
    '天機·巨門': { title:`Money earned with a sharp mind and a sharp tongue`, story:`With Tian Ji and Ju Men in your Wealth palace, you are good at analysis and explanation, and money often comes from expertise, teaching and negotiation. You are a picky spender who researches and questions everything, and sales talk rarely moves you. Your blind spot is suspicion, and money can easily lead to arguments.`, scenes:[`Buying insurance, you question the agent until they run out of answers, then read the policy yourself before deciding.`,`Splitting utilities with a roommate, you calculate it down to the cent; they think you are petty and the two of you stop speaking for a week.`], advice:`Before sharing costs with anyone, agree on the rules and write them down to save yourself arguments later.` },
    '天機·天梁': { title:`The strategist's notes are worth more than the vault`, story:`With Tian Ji and Tian Liang in your Wealth palace, your money mostly comes from expertise and advice; like a strategist, you use experience to solve problems for others and get paid for it. You handle money cautiously and plan well, but you also love giving others advice, and sometimes you end up giving them money too.`, scenes:[`A friend asks whether to move house, and you spend a whole evening running mortgage numbers for them in exchange for one coffee.`,`You may own several personal finance books full of notes, of which you have actually put one or two ideas into practice.`], advice:`Your professional time is worth paying for; even with friends, you can set a limit on how many times or hours you advise for free.` },
    '太陽': { title:`Light others first, and money follows`, story:`With Tai Yang in your Wealth palace, reputation and word of mouth usually come first and income follows. You spend generously, love treating people and sharing, and feel happy when others are happy. {{B:太陽:When Tai Yang is strong, your sources of income are clear and you can comfortably carry a generous lifestyle.|When Tai Yang is weak, you often give more than you get back, and your hand reaches for the bill faster than your wallet can keep up.}}`, scenes:[`In group orders you are usually the one who pays up front, and there are always two people who forget to pay you back.`,`You offer to pay for the team dinner and only notice at the end of the month how much higher the card bill is.`], advice:`Cap how much you will front for others and agree on a payback date, so you stay generous and still protect your cash.` },
    '太陽·太陰': { title:`One light by day, another by night`, story:`With Tai Yang and Tai Yin, sun and moon, together in your Wealth palace, your finances have a bright side and a dim side: you may have two sources of income at once, or go through stretches that are loose and stretches that are tight. You swing between splurging and saving, and your mood strongly affects your spending. The key is smoothing out the ups and downs.`, scenes:[`You might work a day job and freelance or run an online shop at night, and only feel secure with both incomes combined.`,`In a good mood you buy drinks for the whole office; in a bad one you will not even spend on a coffee.`], advice:`In good months save an extra twenty percent as a buffer for lean ones, and do not let the day's mood decide how much you spend.` },
    '太陽·巨門': { title:`Turning reputation into income with your voice`, story:`With Tai Yang and Ju Men in your Wealth palace, you earn by speaking: teaching, sales, media and languages are all paths to money for you. The bigger your name, the steadier your income. Your blind spot is overpromising, or arguing over money in a way that hurts your reputation.`, scenes:[`A single talk or video may bring you a new client, which works better than handing out a hundred business cards.`,`When a client haggles you are too blunt; you close the deal, but they never come back.`], advice:`Before talking price, write down three bottom-line numbers and stick to them, with less improvised emotional language.` },
    '太陽·天梁': { title:`Reputation arrives first, money catches up slowly`, story:`With Tai Yang and Tian Liang in your Wealth palace, your wealth comes name first and profit second, built on expertise, track record and credibility rather than speculation. You love helping people and often put money and effort into other people's problems. Income is usually steady but rarely jumps overnight.`, scenes:[`Your income may only really climb after you earn a professional certification; that piece of paper beats any sales pitch.`,`A younger colleague says money is tight, you say "just take it," and nobody mentions a repayment date again.`], advice:`Before lending, decide how much you could accept never getting back, and politely decline anything above that.` },
    '武曲': { title:`An iron rice bowl hammered out blow by blow`, story:`Wu Qu is the wealth star, and it feels most at home in the Wealth palace. You earn in a practical, decisive way, trading real skill and execution for pay, and you are especially sharp with numbers. Your blind spot is valuing money's efficiency too much; even with people close to you, money talk is strictly by the book and can make the mood stiff.`, scenes:[`You probably knew your fixed monthly costs early on, down to the last few dollars.`,`Your partner wants a coffee machine and your first question is "how many times a day, and how long until it pays for itself," and the room goes cold.`], advice:`Leave some "no payback required" fun money in the budget, so money can also buy a bit of warmth.` },
    '武曲·天府': { title:`A safe behind a locked iron door`, story:`With Wu Qu and Tian Fu in your Wealth palace, the wealth star meets the treasury star: you are naturally good at both earning and keeping. Your income leans toward steady, regular pay, and saving feels as natural as breathing. Your blind spot is fear of risk, which means you skimp even on yourself.`, scenes:[`You may have several savings accounts, each with its own purpose, never mixed.`,`On a trip your budget is fine, yet you still pick the cheapest room and later feel you shortchanged yourself.`], advice:`Set aside a fixed sum each year to treat yourself, as a year-end bonus for guarding the treasury so well.` },
    '武曲·天相': { title:`The bookkeeper's seal`, story:`With Wu Qu and Tian Xiang in your Wealth palace, you care about keeping income and spending in balance and manage your own money the way you would keep a company's books. Money mostly comes from a stable position or professional services, and you often look after family and friends' finances too. Your blind spot is handling so much for others that your own plans get shelved.`, scenes:[`Taxes, insurance premiums and loan payments at home all go through you; your parents ask you about everything first.`,`When friends chip in for a gift, you collect the money, front the cost and reconcile the accounts, and still end up short.`], advice:`Keep one evening a month just for your own finances, and put your own savings goals on the calendar first.` },
    '武曲·七殺': { title:`Money sharpened on the blade's edge`, story:`With Wu Qu and Qi Sha in your Wealth palace, you earn through drive and hard skill, willing to take tough jobs and chase high returns. Income often comes in waves: for a while you are too busy to spend, then you live off savings. You spend decisively and buy as soon as you are sure.`, scenes:[`You might work late for several months of the year, and when the year-end bonus lands it feels worth it.`,`When a tool breaks you do not fix it; you buy the best one available and say it saves time.`], advice:`In good months, move thirty percent into an emergency fund first to pave the way for slower seasons.` },
    '武曲·破軍': { title:`Gold recast again and again in the furnace`, story:`With Wu Qu and Po Jun in your Wealth palace, your finances change a lot; you often spend as you earn, or put all your savings into a new direction. You have nerve and are not afraid to scrap everything and start over, but money tends to drain away through one change after another.`, scenes:[`To switch tracks you might spend two years of savings at once on equipment and courses.`,`Your phone is only a year old, but a new feature makes you want to upgrade, and selling the old one barely recovers anything.`], advice:`Split your money into two buckets, "the untouchable base" and "money I can afford to restart with," and only use the second to try new directions.` },
    '武曲·貪狼': { title:`A late-ripening but sturdy fruit tree`, story:`With Wu Qu and Tan Lang in your Wealth palace, your finances start slow and speed up; when young you often feel money is short, and things improve once you have built skills and connections. You know how to enjoy life and how to negotiate, and you have more than one way to earn.`, scenes:[`In your twenties you may have lived paycheck to paycheck, then found after thirty that the network you built along the way doubled your income.`,`You have dinner and a chat with friends, and somewhere in the conversation a collaboration is born.`], advice:`Start saving ten percent of your monthly income while you are young, so the good luck later has something to multiply.` },
    '天同': { title:`A stream that flows in at its own easy pace`, story:`With Tian Tong in your Wealth palace, you are not greedy about money; enough is enough, and you prefer spending on a comfortable life. Your finances often go through a hard stretch first and then settle down. {{B:天同:When Tian Tong is strong, you have no worries about the basics and some to spare.|When Tian Tong is only average, money comes in a little slower and you need to plan a bit more yourself.}}`, scenes:[`You will pay more for a good mattress or a comfortable sofa, but do not pay much attention to your savings balance.`,`While friends talk eagerly about investing, you are thinking about which café to go to this weekend.`], advice:`Set up an automatic transfer to savings on payday, so saving does not depend on willpower and you can still live comfortably.` },
    '天同·太陰': { title:`A jar of coins under soft moonlight`, story:`With Tian Tong and Tai Yin in your Wealth palace, your money mostly comes from gentle, steady work, or from fields tied to beauty, service or caring for people. You spend on feeling: things that are pretty, comfortable and atmospheric move you most. {{B:天同:When these stars are bright, a slow and steady trickle adds up to a sizeable sum.|When these stars are dim, you tend to spend according to your mood and your savings rise and fall.}}`, scenes:[`On a rainy night you might browse online shops and end up with scented candles and two blankets without quite meaning to.`,`You have a jar just for your travel fund, and watching the number grow makes you feel safe.`], advice:`When you are feeling low, leave what you want to buy in the cart for three days before deciding whether to check out.` },
    '天同·巨門': { title:`A cup of tea that is bitter first, sweet later`, story:`With Tian Tong and Ju Men in your Wealth palace, money often comes the hard way: more talking, more effort, or only after a misunderstanding is cleared up do you get what you are owed. Money makes you anxious; you say you do not care, but inside you are always counting. Once things build up, though, your finances have real staying power.`, scenes:[`After finishing a project you may have to chase the final payment several times, and it feels awkward every time you ask.`,`You and your partner fight over a small purchase, and only afterward realize you were really fighting about security.`], advice:`Before taking on work, put the payment date in the contract or in writing, so chasing payment is just following the rules rather than a test of nerve.` },
    '天同·天梁': { title:`A steady salary collected in the shade of a tree`, story:`With Tian Tong and Tian Liang in your Wealth palace, your finances lean toward stability, suiting a fixed salary and a workplace with good benefits. You care more about quality of life than making a fortune, and you often spend on family and friends. Your blind spot is being too content with the status quo and not pushing for raises.`, scenes:[`You may have stayed at one company for five years because the benefits that come with seniority make it hard to leave.`,`When a friend is in hospital you send a generous gift without a second thought, and eat out a bit less that month.`], advice:`Talk to your manager about pay and responsibilities once a year; stability also deserves to be priced correctly.` },
    '廉貞': { title:`A wallet caught between rules and desire`, story:`With Lian Zhen in your Wealth palace, you earn on principle and know how to manage relationships; money often comes from expertise and people skills. You have your own standards for spending: shrewd most of the time, but when you truly love something or care about someone, you can spend a lot at once.`, scenes:[`You compare unit prices on toilet paper, yet buy a designer piece you love without hesitating.`,`Your work connections bring you projects, but the gifts and dinners that keep those relationships going are not cheap either.`], advice:`Make social spending a fixed budget line and review it each quarter to see which relationships are worth continuing to invest in.` },
    '廉貞·天府': { title:`The shrewd keeper at the city gate`, story:`With Lian Zhen and Tian Fu in your Wealth palace, you handle money shrewdly and steadily, good at both bringing it in and cutting costs. Money mostly comes from management, planning or professional roles, and it builds slowly but solidly. You spend according to plan, and occasionally your calculating puts pressure on the people around you.`, scenes:[`You might track household spending in a spreadsheet, down to the difference between summer and winter electricity bills.`,`When friends suggest a big dinner out, you check the menu prices online before deciding what to order.`], advice:`Save your careful calculations for the big items and let the small stuff go now and then; life will feel much lighter.` },
    '廉貞·天相': { title:`Measured money that stays within the rules`, story:`With Lian Zhen and Tian Xiang in your Wealth palace, your finances do well within a system: steady income and clear accounts. You have principles about money; you take what is yours without apology and do not touch what is not. Your blind spot is caring so much about fairness that any uneven split stays on your mind.`, scenes:[`When a bonus is shared among colleagues, you propose how to calculate the split first to avoid awkwardness later.`,`When someone gives you an expensive gift, your first thought is "what do I give back so I don't owe them."`], advice:`Write fairness into rules, then let go once they are set; you do not need to recalculate every transaction in your head.` },
    '廉貞·七殺': { title:`A road to wealth you cut through the mountain yourself`, story:`With Lian Zhen and Qi Sha in your Wealth palace, you earn by forging your own path; you can endure hardship and setbacks only make you more determined. Income is usually fought for: hard early on, then quite substantial once you get through. You do not fuss over small change, but you throw everything into goals you believe in.`, scenes:[`You might work by day and study at night, pulling your income up one level at a time.`,`To buy a piece of professional equipment, you are willing to skip going out for six months.`], advice:`Set a few staged savings goals and celebrate a little each time you hit one, giving the long haul some rhythm.` },
    '廉貞·破軍': { title:`An experimental workshop, built and rebuilt`, story:`With Lian Zhen and Po Jun in your Wealth palace, your finances change often; you love new things and new methods, and trying them often brings extra costs. You earn reasonably well, but holding on to money takes deliberate practice. Spending is most likely to get out of hand when emotions or impulses run high.`, scenes:[`You might redo your whole room in a new style in one evening, then see the credit card alert the next day.`,`A friend asks you to join a side business and you dive in without working out the costs, only calling it off three months later.`], advice:`Pick one day each month to review subscriptions and installment plans, and cancel anything you no longer use that same day.` },
    '廉貞·貪狼': { title:`A running tab under bright lights`, story:`With Lian Zhen and Tan Lang in your Wealth palace, your money is often tied to people, entertainment and aesthetics; you are highly social and use money to build relationships. You know how to enjoy life and do not hold back on food, clothes or gatherings. Your blind spot is that with more desires, money quietly drains away amid the fun.`, scenes:[`Two parties and a concert in one weekend, and on Monday you are a bit afraid to open your banking app.`,`Several deals were closed over dinner, but you were also the one who paid for those dinners.`], advice:`Before each night out, decide on a spending limit and pay with a card or account that has that limit set.` },
    '天府': { title:`A granary stacked full of grain`, story:`Tian Fu is the treasury star, and in your Wealth palace it shows you know how to keep money; once it is in your pocket, it does not leave easily. You spend conservatively, valuing practicality and security, and you suit steady, step-by-step accumulation. Your blind spot is wanting stability so much that you keep postponing even worthwhile spending.`, scenes:[`You had a piggy bank as a child and switched to fixed-term deposits as an adult; a glance at the balance calms you.`,`While colleagues talk about going abroad, you are still comparing which airline earns the most miles.`], advice:`Each year, choose one thing to invest in yourself, whether learning or exercise, so the granary can grow something new.` },
    '太陰': { title:`Moonlight sprinkled into the savings jar, little by little`, story:`Tai Yin is a star of wealth, and in your Wealth palace it brings money that trickles in steadily; you suit slow accumulation, especially toward savings and a home of your own. You manage money carefully, spend on how things feel, and lean toward gentle, refined things. {{B:太陰:When Tai Yin is strong, you build up steadily and substantially.|When Tai Yin is weak, money tends to make you anxious, and you save, spend, then regret it.}}`, scenes:[`You may have an account just for a down payment and quietly transfer money into it each month.`,`On sleepless nights you open shopping sites and add the things you cannot quite bring yourself to buy to your favorites.`], advice:`Write your long-term goals as concrete numbers and dates, and look at them when you feel anxious, as a reminder that you are moving forward.` },
    '貪狼': { title:`Wealth sparked by the fire of desire`, story:`With Tan Lang in your Wealth palace, you have many ways to earn, through connections, talents and socializing, with the occasional windfall. You have a gift for enjoying life and are happy to spend on food, fun and hobbies. {{B:貪狼:When Tan Lang is strong, you can turn your interests into income.|When Tan Lang is only average, money tends to go out faster than it comes in.}}`, scenes:[`Because you can mix a good drink, friends might ask you to help at an event, and you pick up some extra cash.`,`When a limited edition drops you often grab it on release, and only later remember you already have one at home.`], advice:`Put half of any windfall straight into savings, and enjoy the other half.` },
    '巨門': { title:`A gold mine dug out of words`, story:`With Ju Men in your Wealth palace, money often comes through eloquence, expertise and competition; the clearer you explain and the deeper you analyze, the more you earn. You are alert about money and do not easily trust other people's recommendations. {{B:巨門:When Ju Men is strong, your words become a source of income.|When Ju Men is weak, watch for arguments over money, and your income may never quite feel secure.}}`, scenes:[`In pricing meetings, you are often the one who persuades the other side and closes the deal on the spot.`,`A friend does not repay a loan on time; you hold it in for a long time, and when you finally speak up, it comes out harsh.`], advice:`Keep written records of all money dealings; when things are clear, there is no need to argue.` },
    '天相': { title:`The dignity of never going without`, story:`With Tian Xiang in your Wealth palace, your finances are steady and you rarely lack the basics; income mostly comes from a position or service work. You care about appearance and etiquette, and spend willingly on clothes and social courtesies. You are also easily swayed by people around you; when friends buy something, you want it too.`, scenes:[`Before a wedding you buy a new outfit specially, because that seems like basic courtesy.`,`Colleagues organize a group order for skincare; you had no plans to buy, but you join in anyway.`], advice:`Before joining a group purchase, ask yourself: if nobody had suggested it, would I still buy this?` },
    '天梁': { title:`An old tree's shade is not a money tree`, story:`With Tian Liang in your Wealth palace, your money suits slow accumulation through expertise, experience and credibility, not get-rich-quick schemes. You tend to spend on caring for people: elders, younger relatives, friends in trouble, you want to help them all. {{B:天梁:When Tian Liang is strong, helpful mentors often bring you opportunities.|When Tian Liang is weak, money comes with more twists and turns, and a soft heart can cost you.}}`, scenes:[`At a family gathering an elder asks you to help support a relative, and it is hard for you to say no.`,`Someone invites you into a quick-money scheme, your gut says something is off, and later you turn out to be right.`], advice:`Before helping someone, make sure your own living costs and emergency fund are untouched, then decide how much to give.` },
    '七殺': { title:`Spoils won single-handed`, story:`With Qi Sha in your Wealth palace, your finances have a sprinting quality; you earn through nerve and action, it is tough early on, and once you lay the foundation, income can be considerable. You spend decisively too: once you are sure, you buy and rarely look back. Your blind spot is the big swings and the occasional burst of overspending in a generous mood.`, scenes:[`When a big project lands you throw yourself into it, your income doubles for three months, and then you face a dry spell.`,`You see a motorcycle you like and order it the same day, without hesitating even over the color.`], advice:`Keep at least six months of living expenses in reserve, so every sprint comes without worries behind you.` },
    '破軍': { title:`In and out like the tide`, story:`With Po Jun in your Wealth palace, money comes in big and goes out big, and you spend without hesitation on new things and new experiments. You have an enterprising streak in earning and often find opportunities where others dare not go. Your blind spot is holding on to it: easy come, easy go.`, scenes:[`Your year-end bonus has barely landed before you trade it in for a whole new set of camera gear.`,`Your room holds several things you used once or twice, each of which was a "must-have" at the time.`], advice:`Before buying something new, sell or give away something old first, adding one more checkpoint to spending.` },
    '空': { title:`A view borrowed by an empty room`, story:`Your Wealth palace has no main star, so your finances borrow the stars of the opposite palace, Fortune, and are especially shaped by your surroundings and the people around you. With people who manage money well, you save; when everyone around you loves to spend, you spend too. The upside is flexibility: you can adjust how you earn at any time.`, scenes:[`After moving in with a frugal roommate, you find yourself packing your own lunch without really deciding to.`,`A new job with a different pay structure changes your spending habits completely.`], advice:`Make a point of talking often with one or two friends who are sensible with money, and let a good environment carry you along.` }
  },
  career: {
    '紫微': { title:`The one in the main seat`, story:`With Zi Wei in your Career palace, you are naturally suited to a leading position, good at overseeing the big picture and making the final call. You care about titles and respect, and you perform best when you have a stage and real authority. Your blind spot is difficulty stepping down from that position and listening to the people on the front line.`, fields:`Management, senior executive roles, public sector leadership, brand management, running your own business.`, scenes:[`When a meeting reaches a deadlock, it is often one sentence from you that settles it.`,`When you are asked to do photocopying or order lunch, you say nothing, but inside you feel your talents are being wasted.`], advice:`Chat with one or two front-line colleagues each month; your decisions will be better grounded for it.` },
    '紫微·天府': { title:`Headquarters guarded by two sovereigns`, story:`With Zi Wei and Tian Fu in your Career palace, you are steady and think on a large scale, good at managing big systems and resources. You suit working your way up through a large, well-structured organization, and you value stability over speed. Your blind spot is caution, so you can be a step behind when change comes.`, fields:`Corporate management, financial institutions, government agencies, administration and facilities, asset management.`, scenes:[`When the company merges departments, you are often the first person the boss thinks of to lead it.`,`When a new colleague pitches a bold idea, your first reaction is to ask where the risks are.`], advice:`Each year, pick one new way of working and try it yourself, so there is forward momentum inside your steadiness.` },
    '紫微·天相': { title:`The chief steward holding the great seal`, story:`With Zi Wei and Tian Xiang in your Career palace, you value rules, process and fairness, and you are good at bringing parties together so things run in order. You thrive in organizations with clear systems and are often the colleague everyone trusts to arbitrate. Your blind spot is caring so much about image and rules that you come across as stiff when the unexpected happens.`, fields:`Administrative management, legal, human resources, public relations, chief of staff, quality management.`, scenes:[`When two departments fight over resources, your manager asks you to mediate, and you start by listing both sides' needs in a table.`,`When a colleague wants to skip the process and take a shortcut, you tell them straight out, "That won't work."`], advice:`Leave yourself some room to adapt on the spot; rules are a tool, not the goal.` },
    '紫微·破軍': { title:`A new ruler who tears down the old city to rebuild`, story:`With Zi Wei and Po Jun in your Career palace, you suit building and reform, and you like tearing down old systems to rebuild them. You have vision and boldness, and you shine most in units that need transformation. Your blind spot is impatience; once a system is running smoothly, you want to move on to the next challenge.`, fields:`Startups, organizational change, new product development, business expansion, rebranding.`, scenes:[`In your first month at a new company, you have already handed your manager a proposal to change a process.`,`After two stable years in a job, you start to feel bored and quietly open job sites.`], advice:`Whenever you push for reform, team up with someone who is good at execution, so your ideas actually land.` },
    '紫微·七殺': { title:`A general marching out with the seal of command`, story:`With Zi Wei and Qi Sha in your Career palace, you act decisively and boldly, like being in control, and the bigger the challenge, the more fired up you get. You suit leading a team toward a target, with strong execution. Your blind spot is setting standards so high that your team struggles to breathe.`, fields:`Sales management, project management, military and police, entrepreneurship, operations management.`, scenes:[`In the end-of-quarter push, you lead the team through several nights of overtime and beat the target.`,`When a report is not good enough, you send it straight back for a rewrite, and the author quietly tears up.`], advice:`When giving instructions, add one sentence about the goal and the reason, and your team will be more willing to charge ahead with you.` },
    '紫微·貪狼': { title:`The brightest host in the ballroom`, story:`With Zi Wei and Tan Lang in your Career palace, you are versatile and socially skilled, suited to work that calls for connections and taste. You can close deals at social events and you are good at packaging and marketing. Your blind spot is having too many interests and getting distracted, or getting caught up in endless socializing.`, fields:`Public relations, marketing, entertainment, restaurant management, luxury retail, event planning.`, scenes:[`At an industry reception you swap twenty business cards and set up two collaborations the following week.`,`You want to run a social media channel, learn bartending and start a side business all at once, and your main job falls behind.`], advice:`Choose just one main goal each quarter and push it hard, putting other interests on hold.` },
    '天機': { title:`A gear that never stops turning`, story:`With Tian Ji in your Career palace, you have a nimble mind, good at analysis, planning and problem solving, and you would rather use your head than do repetitive work. {{B:天機:When Tian Ji is strong, your ideas save the team from many detours.|When Tian Ji is weak, you tend to overthink and keep changing your plans.}} You also change jobs more often than most people.`, fields:`Planning, software engineering, data analysis, consulting, research, advisory staff roles.`, scenes:[`Your manager hands you a vague request, and by the end of the afternoon you have drawn flowcharts for three possible solutions.`,`After a little over a year in a job, you start to feel there is nothing new to learn and want a change of scene.`], advice:`Before you quit, list three things you can still learn in this job, and leave once you have learned them.` },
    '天機·太陰': { title:`A planning room with its lamp lit under the moon`, story:`With Tian Ji and Tai Yin in your Career palace, you are detail-minded and good at planning, suited to planning, writing or advisory roles within a stable structure. You work carefully and handle details others miss. When there are transfers or changes at work, your mood tends to rise and fall with them.`, fields:`Civil service, administrative planning, financial analysis, design, editing, education.`, scenes:[`When your manager runs a big event, you lay out every detail of the schedule so that nothing slips through.`,`As soon as news of a restructuring gets out, you start worrying about your position before anyone else.`], advice:`Turn your worries into a concrete list of backup plans, and anxiety becomes preparation.` },
    '天機·巨門': { title:`The researcher who takes problems apart`, story:`With Tian Ji and Ju Men in your Career palace, you have a researcher's curiosity and a way with words, good at analyzing problems and explaining things clearly. You suit specialized work that calls for critical thinking. Your blind spot is nitpicking; when your words get sharp, arguments with colleagues follow.`, fields:`Lawyer, researcher, teacher, consultant, journalist, technical trainer.`, scenes:[`When someone presents a plan in a meeting, you are the first to spot the hole in the logic.`,`Your criticism is on point, but delivered so bluntly that the colleague who made the proposal is down for the rest of the day.`], advice:`When you point out a problem, offer a solution with it; your sharpness becomes an asset to the team.` },
    '天機·天梁': { title:`The strategist planning inside the tent`, story:`With Tian Ji and Tian Liang in your Career palace, you are good at devising strategy and reading situations, suited to being a consultant or adviser. You know a lot, love giving advice, and are often the person everyone comes to. Your blind spot is talking more than doing, or getting too involved in other people's business.`, fields:`Management consulting, planning, healthcare, religious and spiritual services, education and training.`, scenes:[`Colleagues stuck on a problem often come to you, and every chat turns into half an hour.`,`You write a very thorough strategy report, then hand the execution to someone else.`], advice:`Pick one of your own recommendations and carry it all the way through yourself, so people can see you deliver.` },
    '太陽': { title:`The spotlight that lights up the whole stage`, story:`With Tai Yang in your Career palace, you are warm and responsible, suited to work that faces the public and requires credibility. {{B:太陽:You act openly, and your reputation brings promotions.|You often work hard for a long time without being noticed.}} You are glad to give, and you often take on too much.`, fields:`Civil service, education, media, politics, nonprofits, sales.`, scenes:[`When the company holds an event, you always volunteer to host or coordinate.`,`You help a colleague wrap up their work, and the credit ends up under their name.`], advice:`Keep a record of what you have finished and report it proactively, so your effort gets seen.` },
    '太陽·太陰': { title:`Two jobs, one by day and one by night`, story:`With Tai Yang and Tai Yin in your Career palace, you combine outgoing drive with quiet attention to detail, and your work has a visible side and a behind-the-scenes side. You may run two kinds of work at once, or your work may be split between day and night. Your blind spot is wavering direction and being busy on both fronts.`, fields:`Shift work, media, design, education, side businesses, service industries.`, scenes:[`You work at the office by day and run your own social media account or small shop at night.`,`One day you want to push sales, the next you want to move behind the scenes, and your manager is never quite sure what you want.`], advice:`Every six months, review what you put into and get out of each side, and decide for yourself where your focus goes.` },
    '太陽·巨門': { title:`The voice coming through the loudspeaker`, story:`With Tai Yang and Ju Men in your Career palace, you speak well and persuasively, suited to work that involves talking and facing the public. You are open to foreign languages and other cultures. Your blind spot is speaking your mind too quickly; a single sentence can stir up trouble.`, fields:`Teacher, trainer, lawyer, media, sales at international companies, translation.`, scenes:[`When you present, people in the audience find themselves nodding along.`,`A passing complaint you make in a group chat gets screenshotted and sent to your manager.`], advice:`Before speaking in public, pause for three seconds and ask yourself whether you would be fine with this being forwarded.` },
    '太陽·天梁': { title:`The lighthouse watching over ships at night`, story:`With Tai Yang and Tian Liang in your Career palace, you have a sense of justice and professionalism, suited to large institutions or the public sector, where you rise through expertise and reputation. You enjoy mentoring younger colleagues. Your blind spot is standing up for others and taking on responsibilities that are not yours.`, fields:`Civil service, healthcare, education, social work, legal, work that requires professional licenses.`, scenes:[`When a new hire gets scolded by the manager, you quietly show them how to avoid the same mistake.`,`When a colleague is treated unfairly you speak up, and then find yourself under scrutiny too.`], advice:`Before stepping in to help, ask what the other person actually needs; your goodwill will carry more weight.` },
    '武曲': { title:`The doer holding an iron ruler`, story:`With Wu Qu in your Career palace, you are practical, decisive and efficient, and especially sharp with numbers and results. You suit work with clear targets and an emphasis on execution; tasks given to you rarely drag. Your blind spot is bluntness and people skills that are not quite soft enough.`, fields:`Finance, banking, accounting, engineering, military and police, manufacturing management.`, scenes:[`When a project falls behind, you list everyone's progress in a table and get it back on track within a day.`,`Colleagues say you come across as harsh, but you feel you are just stating facts.`], advice:`When assigning work, add a word of thanks or recognition; the efficiency stays the same and the team will be more willing to cooperate.` },
    '武曲·天府': { title:`The steward guarding the treasury door`, story:`With Wu Qu and Tian Fu in your Career palace, you are steady and follow the rules, good at managing money and resources. You work solidly and suit a long career in a large institution, becoming more relied upon the longer you stay. Your blind spot is caution that keeps new methods out.`, fields:`Banking, accountancy, chief financial officer, asset management, insurance, government finance.`, scenes:[`You guard the company budget, and anyone who wants to spend an extra dollar has to get past you first.`,`When a colleague suggests switching to a new system, you first ask how much longer the old one will last.`], advice:`Learn one new tool or skill each year, so there is growth inside the stability.` },
    '武曲·天相': { title:`The head clerk who manages both books and people`, story:`With Wu Qu and Tian Xiang in your Career palace, you are good at finance and administration, meticulous and trustworthy. You suit work that requires integrity and precision. Your blind spot is cleaning up after others so often that you wear yourself out.`, fields:`Accounting, finance administration, tax, civil service, bank management, procurement.`, scenes:[`When expense claims get stuck, you are the first person everyone thinks to ask.`,`A colleague makes an error in the books; you grumble, but you quietly fix it for them anyway.`], advice:`Learn to say "please handle this part yourself," and keep your time for what really matters.` },
    '武曲·七殺': { title:`The iron cavalry at the front of the charge`, story:`With Wu Qu and Qi Sha in your Career palace, you are action-oriented and can handle pressure, suited to work that calls for boldness and stamina. You are direct, and the harder something is, the more you want to conquer it. Your blind spot is impatience, which can lead to head-on clashes.`, fields:`Military and police, surgery, engineering, sales, sports, technical crafts.`, scenes:[`You say yes to the tough case others turned down, and still finish before the deadline.`,`When you disagree with your manager you push back on the spot, and the office stays tense for days.`], advice:`When you disagree, start with "I understand your concerns" before giving your view, and things will go much more smoothly.` },
    '武曲·破軍': { title:`A forge where metal is tempered again and again`, story:`With Wu Qu and Po Jun in your Career palace, you are both pioneering and technically skilled, and you like taking on new fields. Your career often has big turns, and each change brings new abilities. Your blind spot is impatience, which can lead you to change direction halfway through.`, fields:`Technical development, engineering, entrepreneurship, equipment maintenance, specialized crafts, transformation projects.`, scenes:[`After a few years of work, you might suddenly switch to learning to code, and pick it up quickly.`,`Halfway through a project, your attention gets pulled away by a new opportunity.`], advice:`Before each change, write a wrap-up list for your last role so you carry the full experience with you.` },
    '武曲·貪狼': { title:`A business mind that shines brighter with polish`, story:`With Wu Qu and Tan Lang in your Career palace, you have a head for business and a way with people, suited to work that combines networking with hands-on skill. Your career often builds quietly in youth and starts to shine in midlife. Your blind spot is strong ambition that tempts you to do too much at once.`, fields:`Sales, finance, trade, restaurant management, entertainment, entrepreneurship.`, scenes:[`After a few years in the sales department, you are suddenly promoted to regional manager.`,`You take on three side projects at once and your main job slows down.`], advice:`While young, become top-notch in one specialty first, then expand your network outward.` },
    '天同': { title:`A small workshop beside a hot spring`, story:`With Tian Tong in your Career palace, you are easygoing and like a relaxed, pleasant work atmosphere, and you do not enjoy cutthroat competition. You suit work that serves people and makes them happy. {{B:天同:When Tian Tong is strong, you can stay long and steady in a comfortable environment.|When Tian Tong is only average, a lack of drive can leave you stuck in place.}}`, fields:`Service industries, food and beverage, travel, welfare organizations, early childhood education, leisure and entertainment.`, scenes:[`You are the office mood-lifter; colleagues who are feeling down like to come and chat with you.`,`When your manager wants you to take on a high-pressure project, your first thought is whether you can get out of it.`], advice:`Set yourself a small yearly goal, so your comfort zone has a gentle curve of growth too.` },
    '天同·太陰': { title:`A craft studio in the light rain`, story:`With Tian Tong and Tai Yin in your Career palace, you are gentle, perceptive and have an eye for beauty, suited to work that calls for patience and sensitivity. You like a harmonious workplace and avoid conflict. Your blind spot is that emotions easily affect your efficiency; one small thing can distract you for half a day.`, fields:`Design, beauty and hairdressing, art, writing, social welfare, nursing.`, scenes:[`The color schemes in your slides always catch people's eye.`,`One careless remark from a colleague can keep you from concentrating for the whole afternoon.`], advice:`Note in a work journal the feelings that distract you; once you see the pattern, you can look after yourself earlier.` },
    '天同·巨門': { title:`The storyteller whose sweetness comes after the bitterness`, story:`With Tian Tong and Ju Men in your Career palace, you have both eloquence and empathy, suited to work that involves communicating and explaining. Your career may go through a hard stretch first, but it has staying power. Your blind spot is getting caught up in office drama or falling into self-doubt.`, fields:`Customer service, sales, teaching, counseling, food and beverage, interpreting.`, scenes:[`When you started, clients often gave you a hard time; three years later you are the contact everyone trusts most.`,`Office rumors are flying, and even though you took no part, you get dragged in.`], advice:`Stay friendly with colleagues but keep boundaries; when gossip starts, make a brief appearance and move on.` },
    '天同·天梁': { title:`A big tree giving everyone shade`, story:`With Tian Tong and Tian Liang in your Career palace, you are kind and steady, suited to work that cares for and serves people, and you can stay long within an institution. You like helping others and have your own working rhythm. Your blind spot is a lack of drive, so promotions often go to someone else.`, fields:`Civil service, healthcare, social work, education, insurance, long-term care.`, scenes:[`You have been at the hospital or school for years, and longtime colleagues say they feel at ease when you are around.`,`When a chance at a management role comes up, you pass it to a colleague because you feel it is not for you.`], advice:`Next time an opportunity comes, do not rush to turn it down; give yourself one chance to try.` },
    '廉貞': { title:`Dancing on the edge of the rules`, story:`With Lian Zhen in your Career palace, you work on principle yet know how to adapt and manage relationships, suited to work that calls for both finesse and expertise. You are ambitious and demanding of yourself. Your blind spot is a competitive streak that, under pressure, can send you down a rabbit hole.`, fields:`Public relations, legal, politics, administrative management, electronics and technology, precision engineering.`, scenes:[`In cross-department meetings, you can keep every side's position in view and end up reaching a consensus.`,`If one small thing goes wrong, you replay it in your head for days.`], advice:`Set yourself a "good enough" standard and save your energy for the next goal.` },
    '廉貞·天府': { title:`The steward who holds the line`, story:`With Lian Zhen and Tian Fu in your Career palace, you are shrewd and steady, good at management and planning, suited to work that is built over the long term. You work to a plan and care whether resources are used well. Your blind spot is caution that sometimes makes you miss the best moment.`, fields:`Administrative management, financial planning, business management, property management, government agencies.`, scenes:[`The department you run keeps its budget just right, year after year.`,`When a new opportunity appears, you assess it for so long that someone else gets there first.`], advice:`Give each decision a deadline, and when it arrives, act on the best judgment you have at that moment.` },
    '廉貞·天相': { title:`A weight on the scales of fairness`, story:`With Lian Zhen and Tian Xiang in your Career palace, you value fairness and order and are good at balancing interests within the rules; people trust you. You suit work with clear structures that demands integrity. Your blind spot is holding so firmly to principle that people find you hard to approach.`, fields:`Legal, administration, human resources, auditing, civil service, quality management.`, scenes:[`When a dispute breaks out at the company, you are asked to act as the go-between.`,`Someone asks you to bend the rules a little, you refuse outright, and they hold it against you from then on.`], advice:`When you stand on principle, soften your tone a little and your fairness will be easier to accept.` },
    '廉貞·七殺': { title:`The pioneer clearing a path through the thorns`, story:`With Lian Zhen and Qi Sha in your Career palace, you have drive and resilience, suited to work that means fighting hard and building from nothing. You are willing to endure hardship, and difficulty only fires you up. Your blind spot is going it alone and carrying everything yourself.`, fields:`Business development, engineering, military and police, surgery, entrepreneurship, technical crafts.`, scenes:[`When the company opens a new market, you volunteer for the hardest region.`,`Your project is stuck, but you do not ask for help until the very last moment, when it all blows up.`], advice:`When you hit a wall, talk it over with someone right away; you do not have to fight every battle alone.` },
    '廉貞·破軍': { title:`The adventurer who breaks the mold`, story:`With Lian Zhen and Po Jun in your Career palace, you dare to experiment and dislike well-worn paths, suited to work with lots of change that calls for innovation. Your career may have big ups and downs and frequent changes of direction. Your blind spot is impulsiveness: jumping in before the plan is thought through.`, fields:`Entrepreneurship, new media, tech R&D, specialized crafts, crisis management.`, scenes:[`You might change jobs twice in a year, picking up a completely new skill each time.`,`Your manager says "let's look into it first," and you have already built a first prototype.`], advice:`Before acting, write down three possible risks and how you would handle them, giving your drive a safety net.` },
    '廉貞·貪狼': { title:`The social star shining in a crowd`, story:`With Lian Zhen and Tan Lang in your Career palace, you are socially adept and multitalented, suited to work that relies on charm and connections. You are in your element at social events, and clients enjoy dealing with you. Your blind spot is too much socializing, which can leave you led around by obligations and temptations.`, fields:`Public relations, entertainment, food and beverage, beauty industry, sales, event planning.`, scenes:[`After a dinner party, every client remembers your name.`,`You have accepted too many invitations, and the report for your main job keeps getting pushed back.`], advice:`Block out regular focus time each week and keep it untouched, no matter how many invitations come in.` },
    '天府': { title:`The steward who guards the whole city`, story:`With Tian Fu in your Career palace, you are steady and reliable, good at management and coordination, suited to long-term growth in a well-structured organization. You work methodically and dislike risk. Your blind spot is wanting stability so much that chances for a breakthrough slip away.`, fields:`Administrative management, finance, banking, government agencies, large corporations.`, scenes:[`Your files are always neatly organized; a new hire understands them at a glance.`,`Someone invites you to join a new project; you think about it for a long time and end up declining.`], advice:`Give yourself a small risk allowance each year and take on one task outside your comfort zone.` },
    '太陰': { title:`Fine work that glows quietly at night`, story:`With Tai Yin in your Career palace, you are perceptive and gentle, good at planning and attending to details, suited to stable work that calls for patience. {{B:太陰:When Tai Yin is strong, you produce fine, careful results behind the scenes and earn deep trust.|When Tai Yin is weak, changes in your work environment can easily leave you unsettled.}}`, fields:`Design, finance, real estate, editing, nursing, industries serving women.`, scenes:[`Your proposals are so complete that your manager barely needs to edit them.`,`During months of frequent staff changes at the company, you often lie awake at night.`], advice:`Sort your worries into two columns, things you can control and things you cannot, and deal only with the first.` },
    '貪狼': { title:`The multitalented performer`, story:`With Tan Lang in your Career palace, you have wide interests and learn fast, suited to work that calls for creativity, social skills and a range of abilities. {{B:貪狼:When Tan Lang is strong, you can turn your talents into a career.|When Tan Lang is only average, you can end up knowing a bit of everything without going deep in any one thing.}} You shine easily in a crowd.`, fields:`Sales, entertainment, marketing, food and beverage, beauty industry, teaching arts and skills.`, scenes:[`At the company year-end party, everyone always pushes you up on stage to perform.`,`You have learned photography, design and video editing and can do them all, yet your resume has no clear through-line.`], advice:`Pick the skill you love most and go deep on it for three years, until it becomes your signature.` },
    '巨門': { title:`The expert who stands on their words`, story:`With Ju Men in your Career palace, you are good at analysis and expression and like getting to the bottom of things, suited to work that relies on eloquence or specialist knowledge. {{B:巨門:When Ju Men is strong, you can build a reputation on the strength of your words.|When Ju Men is weak, watch for trouble stirred up by things you say.}}`, fields:`Lawyer, teacher, trainer, sales, researcher, media.`, scenes:[`In a meeting you point out a problem everyone else missed, and your manager sees you in a new light.`,`A joke you make is misunderstood by a colleague, and it takes a week to clear things up.`], advice:`Confirm important things again in writing to cut down on spoken misunderstandings.` },
    '天相': { title:`The poised and capable right hand`, story:`With Tian Xiang in your Career palace, you value proper conduct and are good at supporting and coordinating, suited to being a capable right hand in a stable organization. You work conscientiously and people trust you. Your blind spot is caring too much what others think and not daring to voice your own opinion.`, fields:`Executive assistant, administration, human resources, public relations, paralegal, service industry management.`, scenes:[`When your manager is overloaded, you are the first person they ask for help.`,`You clearly disagree in a meeting, yet choose to stay silent.`], advice:`In every meeting, share at least one view of your own so others can see how you think.` },
    '天梁': { title:`The elder who shelters the whole village`, story:`With Tian Liang in your Career palace, you are responsible and like looking after people, often playing the one who solves everyone's problems, suited to work that requires expertise and trust. {{B:天梁:When Tian Liang is strong, you are respected in your professional field.|When Tian Liang is weak, you often worry too much about other people's affairs.}}`, fields:`Healthcare, insurance, education, social work, consulting, civil service.`, scenes:[`When colleagues run into trouble, you are the first person they think to talk to.`,`You solve someone else's problem, and your own work falls behind.`], advice:`Before helping others, check your own progress; you can only look after others once you have looked after yourself.` },
    '七殺': { title:`The vanguard general who clears the road alone`, story:`With Qi Sha in your Career palace, you have boldness and drive, suited to work where you stand on your own and open new ground. You are decisive and dislike being micromanaged. Your blind spot is being too headstrong to take in other people's views.`, fields:`Entrepreneurship, business development, military and police, surgery, engineering, sports-related work.`, scenes:[`You take on a project nobody else dared to touch and deliver results within three months.`,`Your manager gives you advice; you nod, then go back and do it your own way.`], advice:`Find someone you trust to act as an adviser and listen to a different voice on a regular basis.` },
    '破軍': { title:`The one who knocks down old walls to build anew`, story:`With Po Jun in your Career palace, you like change and challenge, suited to work that calls for innovation and reform. Your career may have big ups and downs and frequent changes of direction, and each reset teaches you something new. Your blind spot is impulsiveness and a lack of staying power.`, fields:`Entrepreneurship, startups, tech R&D, media, reform projects.`, scenes:[`In your first week at the company, you have already proposed three reforms.`,`Two years into a job, you start thinking about changing direction again.`], advice:`Before you leave, ask yourself: what am I trying to escape, and what am I trying to pursue?` },
    '空': { title:`An empty stage lit with borrowed light`, story:`Your Career palace has no main star, so your career borrows the stars of the opposite palace, Spouse, and is especially shaped by your environment, your managers and your partners. The upside is flexibility and strong adaptability, which let you find a place in many different fields. Your blind spot is a direction that is not clear enough.`, fields:`Cross-disciplinary work, freelancing, project-based roles, family business, partnerships.`, scenes:[`After you get a good manager, your performance suddenly takes a big leap.`,`You may have worked in three completely different industries and adapted well each time.`], advice:`Actively choose environments and partners that help you grow, because they will strongly shape your direction.` }
  }
};
